            "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.optimize import fsolve\n\n# Define the equation\ndef equation(x):\n    return np.sin(x) + x**2 - 42\n\n# Provide an initial guess for x\ninitial_guess = [6, -6]  # positive and negative roots\n\n# Solve the equation\nsolutions = fsolve(equation, initial_guess)\nsolutions",
